<title>ESTONIA: PENNU ISSUE OVER-SUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>PENNU ISSUE OVER-SUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennu Computer's public share issue of 136,000 10-kroons shares was over-subscribed by 4,683 shares, the Tallinn stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The Pennu issue was organised by Baltic Cresco and took place from March 17 to 31, the stock market said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
